# Android phone — Tailscale + Termux (ZTE-008)

Notion: [Virtual Machine Command](https://app.notion.com/p/41e3ef07399280d6ac21da4b39f9d1bf) · Repo: `docs/PHONE_OS_TAILSCALE.md`

## Tailscale

- [ ] Android app, Studex account
- [ ] MagicDNS on; copy device name → hub `LAB_HOST_PHONE`
- [ ] `PHONE_OS=android-termux` in `docs/lab-mesh.env` on Mac

## Termux agent shell

- [ ] `pkg install git curl openssh`
- [ ] Shallow clone Portable-agents; `bash scripts/phone-termux-bootstrap.sh`
- [ ] Optional: `sshd` + Tailscale SSH for Mac to reach phone

## Apps

- [ ] Hermes + MiniMax OAuth
- [ ] OpenBot → Mac hub (optional)
- [ ] Browser: `http://macmini:3100` health on tailnet

## Mac verifies

- [ ] `npm run phone:preflight` PASS
- [ ] VM Registry row **android-studex-phone** → Status Running (no keys in Notion)

## iOS (later)

- [ ] Same tailnet; `PHONE_OS=ios`; Shortcuts hub health; no Termux

## Archive

- [ ] Mac/MSI `agent-work-archive.sh` → Stud-Bot-Depo after milestone